  "title": "Horses",
  "country": "US",
  "released": "1975-11-10",
  "notes": "First pressing.\n\nGlossy cover with title \"Horses\" in white letters.\n\nIssued on light blue labels with white Arista Records logo. Label variation, with different layout to other versions.\n\n\"PP\" etched in runouts denotes [l=Peter Pan Industries] pressing. Remainder of runouts etched, mastering stamped, \"6066\" is scratched out.\n\nIssued with Arista company inner sleeve.\n\nCatalog number AL 4066 on jacket back, labels; 4066 on spine.\n\nOn labels: ℗ 1975 Arista Records, Inc.\nOn jacket: ℗ & © 1975 Arista Records, Inc.\n\nRecorded and mixed at Electric Lady Studios NYC\nMastered at Sterling Sound Inc.\n\nTrack A3 was inspired by Peter Reich and Huey Smith\n\nTrack title variations on jacket:\nA1: \"gloria\"\nB3: \"land\"",
  "released_formatted": "10 Nov 1975",
